{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling Limbs is a rogelite action deduction game, centred around physics-based samurai battles. Your quest for vengeance is not limited by life or time, only knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRIBUTION KNOWS NO BOUNDARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The way of the samurai is found in death</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Yamamoto Tsunetomo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving member of your clan, you will control your few remaining samurai on the battlefields of Japan\u2019s warring states period. By choosing your path through war  you will learn clues to the identity of the shape-shifting sorceress responsible for the destruction of your family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EVER-CHANGING EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The river\u2019s flow is ceaseless, yet none of the water is the same</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -</strong> Kamo no Ch\u014dmei</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be that your warriors fall and battle goes against you, but time is no barrier to revenge. Guess the wrong lord and you will reset the board to begin moving the pieces anew, still armed with the knowledge gained in previous runs. The loyalty of your samurai is not bound by death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW YOUR ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You must understand that there is more than one path to the top of the mountain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Miyamoto Musashi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with real historical power-players of the time in your journey toward vengeance: Oda Nobunaga, Takeda Shingen, Uesugi Kenshin and many more. Each lord has traits, characteristics and opinions that you will uncover and use to deduce your foe\u2019s identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS OF THE TRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The warrior\u2019s weapons are the extension of his body</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Tsunetomo Yamamoto</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with a range of weapons from the age of the samurai and of the legends of its heroes. Falling Limbs has something for every school of training, from katanas, spears and clubs to bows, matchlocks and even a devastating cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE THE CUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Throughout your life advance daily, becoming more skillful than yesterday, more skillful than today. This is never-ending</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Tsunetomo Yamamoto</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with a range of weapons from the age of the samurai and of the legends of its heroes. Falling Limbs has something for every school of training, from katanas, spears and clubs to bows, matchlocks and even a devastating cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>For a samurai, to be indifferent to his attire is to show disrespect for the people who see him. A noble appearance and demeanor have the power to command respect and awe</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Daid\u014dji Y\u016bzan</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your warrior\u2019s armor type, pattern and color to bring your own style to the battlefield, with trillions of possible combinations. Find new pieces for your collection as you fight through Japan and keep your favourite combinations on display in the armor room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/01abd9d94a77c83f35e98cc000f0ec95.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/01abd9d94a77c83f35e98cc000f0ec95.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/01abd9d94a77c83f35e98cc000f0ec95.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AS ONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>An arrow snaps with ease when it is one; bind it with another and it will not break. Take this to heart and be of one mind</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -</i> <i>M\u014dri Motonari</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend to the fight and unearth the story together with local co-op mode. Of course allies quickly turned to enemies in the time of warring states; versus battles can also be fought across the stages of the sengoku jidai.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2456820?t=1760541802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760541802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760541802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760541802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game involves melee and ranged combat appropriate to the warfare of feudal Japan. Successful attacks can result in blood sprays and splatters, dismemberment and beheading, depicted in an illustrated form. This can be disabled in settings."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/04f3b77fe534838f5c604976e59d76b3.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/04f3b77fe534838f5c604976e59d76b3.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/04f3b77fe534838f5c604976e59d76b3.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling Limbs is a rogelite action deduction game, centred around physics-based samurai battles. Your quest for vengeance is not limited by life or time, only knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/4bf87f28eb6fd82015f1d77e5b9862f6.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRIBUTION KNOWS NO BOUNDARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The way of the samurai is found in death</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Yamamoto Tsunetomo</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving member of your clan, you will control your few remaining samurai on the battlefields of Japan\u2019s warring states period. By choosing your path through war  you will learn clues to the identity of the shape-shifting sorceress responsible for the destruction of your family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EVER-CHANGING EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The river\u2019s flow is ceaseless, yet none of the water is the same</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 -</strong> Kamo no Ch\u014dmei</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be that your warriors fall and battle goes against you, but time is no barrier to revenge. Guess the wrong lord and you will reset the board to begin moving the pieces anew, still armed with the knowledge gained in previous runs. The loyalty of your samurai is not bound by death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/7af9623760bdc30af678cfc1f438fe5d.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW YOUR ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You must understand that there is more than one path to the top of the mountain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Miyamoto Musashi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with real historical power-players of the time in your journey toward vengeance: Oda Nobunaga, Takeda Shingen, Uesugi Kenshin and many more. Each lord has traits, characteristics and opinions that you will uncover and use to deduce your foe\u2019s identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOOLS OF THE TRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The warrior\u2019s weapons are the extension of his body</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Tsunetomo Yamamoto</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with a range of weapons from the age of the samurai and of the legends of its heroes. Falling Limbs has something for every school of training, from katanas, spears and clubs to bows, matchlocks and even a devastating cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/08fab411701021d358c56fa1b005d4b6.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE THE CUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Throughout your life advance daily, becoming more skillful than yesterday, more skillful than today. This is never-ending</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Tsunetomo Yamamoto</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with a range of weapons from the age of the samurai and of the legends of its heroes. Falling Limbs has something for every school of training, from katanas, spears and clubs to bows, matchlocks and even a devastating cannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.poster.avif?t=1760541802\" width=606 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.webm?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/844257ab4440fa9129ddaea303293a2f.mp4?t=1760541802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>For a samurai, to be indifferent to his attire is to show disrespect for the people who see him. A noble appearance and demeanor have the power to command respect and awe</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - Daid\u014dji Y\u016bzan</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your warrior\u2019s armor type, pattern and color to bring your own style to the battlefield, with trillions of possible combinations. Find new pieces for your collection as you fight through Japan and keep your favourite combinations on display in the armor room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456820/extras/01abd9d94a77c83f3